      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (IA)(C), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"one year\" dengan perkataan \"two years\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_10__para_h",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "h",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_10",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) The Disciplinary Committee shall not make any order under subsection (1A), based upon any of the circumstances set out in paragraphs (l)(b) to (d), or paragraphs (l)(f) to (o), unless an opportunity of being heard either personally or by a person appointed by the registered Engineer has been given to the registered Engineer against whom the Disciplinary Committee intends to make the order,\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_10__para_i",
