      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dengan menggantikan subseksyen (2) dengan subseksyen yang berikut: \"(2) On receipt of a copy of the notice of appeal, the President of the Board or the Chairman of Disciplinary Committee or in the absence of the President or the Chairman, the member so delegated by the President or the Chairman, shall cause to be prepared and sent to the Chairman of the Appeal Board records or a summary of the records of the proceedings of the Board or the Disciplinary Committee and the statement setting out the grounds on which the Board or the Disciplinary Committee arrived at its decision.\";"
      }
    },
    {
