      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (3)fcJ(iii), dengan menggantikan koma bernoktah di hujung subperenggan itu dengan noktah;"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "b",
      "hasPart": [
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_i",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_ii",
        "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_iii"
      ],
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subseksyen (5) —"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_i",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "i",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (d)(ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"except paragraphs (e) and (/}\" dengan perkataan \"(except paragraphs (e) and (/))\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_ii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "ii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (bb), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"ten\" dengan perkataan \"fifty\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b__subpara_iii",
      "@type": "akn:subparagraph",
      "eli:number": "iii",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_b",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (cc), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"one year\" dengan perkataan \"two years\";"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_c",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "c",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam subperenggan (6)(a)(ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"share-holder\" dengan perkataan \"shareholder\"; dan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6__para_d",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "d",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_6",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dalam perenggan (6)(aa), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"if the Board has\" dengan perkataan \"if the Disciplinary Committee has\". Pindaan seksyen 10"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_7",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "7",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 10(5) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"Board\" dengan perkataan \"Disciplinary Committee\". Pindaan seksyen 10A"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_8",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "8",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Subseksyen 10A(4) Akta ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"twenty one\" dengan perkataan \"twenty-one\". Bahagian baru IIIA"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~cl_9",
      "@type": "akn:clause",
      "eli:number": "9",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Akta ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas seksyen 14 bahagian yang berikut: \"PART IIIA DISCIPLINARY COMMITTEE Establishment of Disciplinary Committee 14A. The Board shall appoint a Disciplinary Committee which shall consist of the following members: (a) a Chairman; and (b) two other members, who have been registered as Professional Engineers for not less than seven years. Powers of Disciplinary Committee 14B. The Disciplinary Committee — (a) shall conduct hearings of any misconduct or complaint against any registered Engineer referred to it by the Investigating Committee; (b) may make any or any combination of the orders specified in section 15 against a registered Engineer under such circumstances as set out in that section. Proceedings of the Disciplinary Committee 14c. (1) Where a member of the Board has been appointed as a member of the Disciplinary Committee in pursuance of section 14A to conduct a hearing of any misconduct or complaint against a registered Engineer, that member of the Disciplinary Committee shall not sit as a member of the Board when the Board conducts a hearing or makes an order under subsection 7A(5) against an Engineering consultancy practice of which the registered Engineer is its sole proprietor, partner, director, shareholder or employee. (2) Subject to the provisions of this Act, the Disciplinary Committee may regulate its own procedures in such manner as it deems fit.\". Pindaan seksyen 15"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~sched_1",
      "@type": "akn:schedule",
      "eli:number": "1",
      "hasPart": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~sched_1__para_19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "dipinda menggantikan perkataan \"15\" dengan perkataan \"7 A, 7B\". Kecualian dan peralihan"
      }
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~sched_1__para_19",
      "@type": "akn:paragraph",
      "eli:number": "19",
      "isPartOf": "https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/45/msa@/~sched_1",
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Semua prosiding di bawah seksyen 7A dan 15 dan perkara yang berhubungan dengan prosiding sedemikian yang belum selesai di hadapan Lembaga, dan semua prosiding di bawah seksyen 24 dan 25 yang belum selesai, sebaik sebelum tarikh mula berkuat kuasanya Akta ini hendaklah, selepas tarikh mula berkuat kuasanya Akta ini, diteruskan seolah-olah Akta ibu tidak dipinda oleh Akta ini."
      }
    }
  ]
}
